.TH KSESH 1 "2026-10-06" "ksesh" "Smart session manager for kitty"
.SH NAME
ksesh - Smart session manager for kitty
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBksesh\fP [\fIoptions\&.\&.\&.\fP] [\fIargument\&.\&.\&.\fP]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ksesh is a smart session manager for the kitty terminal that helps you create and manage kitty sessions quickly and easily using zoxide\&. It is a port of sesh, with kitty's native sessions in place of tmux\&.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB-C, --config\fP
path to config file
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
